                        <p>Over the years, ageing and pregnancy have had adverse effects on the female genital. With the above-mentioned factors, the functionality of the vagina gets impair, which calls in for some solid rejuvenation. With the growing vaginal issues, many clinics like <a href="https://www.iconiquebydrbkgarg.com/">ICONIQUE</a> are catering to <strong>vaginal rejuvenation</strong>. Like other cosmetic procedures, this vaginal cosmetic surgery is a boon to several women, facing discomfort in the vaginal structure. It not only improves the functioning of the organ but also revives the lost comfort in women. Although several women ignore the signs of abnormal functioning of the vagina, some of them opt for a rejuvenation procedure. Starting from Vaginoplasty to Grafting, the Indian Clinic like ICONIQUE caters to advanced <strong>vaginal rejuvenation</strong> procedures. Continue reading the blog to learn more about seven things about Vaginoplasty and other <strong>vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong>.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 class="blog_heading">Vaginal Rejuvenation includes several procedures</h2>
<p>Many people think that <strong>vaginal rejuvenation </strong>is purely a cosmetic procedure, with only surgical treatment. However, vaginal rejuvenation may include non-surgical procedures like stem cell grafting. This procedure is performed on outpatients, and the recovery is quick. However, procedures like Vaginoplasty and <strong>laser vaginal rejuvenation</strong> require proper monitoring and include surgical treatment. A vaginoplasty is a form of <strong>vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong> that tightens the vagina, which had loosened up due to childbirth or ageing. Radio Frequency rejuvenation is yet another form of vaginal tightening surgery that requires proper sedation pre-surgery. The vaginal rejuvenation procedure differs from woman to woman, considering their condition and requirement.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>The vaginoplasty procedure requires anaesthesia</h3>
<p><strong>Vaginoplasty</strong> is one of the most popular female genital cosmetic procedures that is opted for by many women. Being a cosmetic procedure, the doctor treats you with local or general anaesthesia while performing Vaginoplasty. <strong>Vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong> is sensitive. Although <strong>Vaginoplasty</strong> is possible under a sedative depending on the condition of the patient, the doctor has the discretion to decide it.&nbsp;</p>
<p>A Vaginoplasty procedure treats the excess and loosened skin to rejuvenate the look and functioning of the vagina. With multiple vaginal deliveries, the nearby muscle loses its firmness, strength, tone, and functioning. This form of <strong>vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong> ensures restoring the structure and working of the vagina. <strong>Vaginoplasty </strong>is a leading <strong>vaginal rejuvenation</strong> procedure in cases of injury or urinary protrusions.</p>
