<h3 class="blog_heading">Vaginal Rejuvenation is not necessary medically</h3>
<p>Undergoing a vaginal rejuvenation is purely the discretion of the patient. Women tend to lose the strength of their vagina after a certain age or after multiple normal deliveries. For such women, getting a vaginal rejuvenation is purely an option. A loose vagina is not necessarily a problem for many. However, some may experience discomfort. The <strong>vaginoplasty</strong> procedure is fully tailored to the individual needs of the patient. Any medical complication does not demand <strong>vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong>. However, it is the sole responsibility of the doctors to keep the procedure and information confidential. At ICONIQUE, patient&rsquo;s privacy is given utmost priority.&nbsp;</p>
<h3 class="blog_heading">Vaginal rejuvenation procedure improves dysfunction of the urinary bladder</h3>
<p><strong>Vaginal rejuvenation treatment</strong> stimulates the collagen protein in the vaginal muscle and skin. That caters to skin tightening along with enhancement of the vaginal skin tone. Vaginal rejuvenation, being primarily a vagina tightening procedure, ensures to tighten the pelvic muscle. That tightening effect reduces the stress in the urinary bladder. With age, women lose the control to hold their urination while laughing, coughing, sneezing, etc., because of urinary stress inconsistency. This condition is prevalent in several women, and most of them deal with it throughout their life. However, the <strong>vaginal rejuvenation</strong> procedure tightens the pelvic floor muscle and prevents uncontrollable outflow. Besides that, vaginal rejuvenation surgery also addresses problems like vaginal laxity and dryness of the vagina.&nbsp;</p>
