<h3>The cost of female genital rejuvenation depends on the condition of the vagina and other factors</h3>
<p>The cost of <strong>vaginal rejuvenation treatment</strong> varies, depending upon several aspects. First, the type of vaginal rejuvenation procedure determines the cost. If women can get rid of their issues with non-surgical procedures, the charge may be less as compared to a surgical procedure like <strong>Vaginoplasty</strong>. The cost of <strong>vaginal rejuvenation surgery</strong> can also vary with the variant of vaginal skin type and conditions. Vaginal rejuvenation includes the cosmetic surgical procedure, which needs to be performed by an experienced cosmetic surgeon. The experience and skill of the surgeon can also affect the cost of the procedures.</p>
<h3 class="blog_heading">Vaginal Rejuvenation does more than just improving sex life</h3>
<p>There is a myth that women opting for vaginal rejuvenation want their sex life to improve. Vaginal rejuvenation tightens the vagina, thus imparting a better sexual experience. Facts show that more than 80% of women who have undergone vaginal rejuvenation have experienced an improvement in their sexual life. However, in many cases, vaginal rejuvenation is more than just a better sexual experience. With age, women tend to develop multiple issues regarding their vagina. That includes urinary stress inconsistency, dryness, impaired vaginal structure, protrusion of uterus, etc. A <strong>Vaginoplasty</strong> is sure to help women get rid of constant discomfort and irregularities in their vaginal functioning.&nbsp;</p>
